## Interface: 20506
## Title: |cff1784d1ElvUI|r |cfd9b9b9bBag Categories|r
## Notes: Groups ElvUI's bag and bank windows into categories (Quest Items, Currency, BoE, Trade Goods, Recipes, Reagents, Gems, Ammo & Quivers, Bags, Keys, Pets, Toys, Soulbound, Potions & Consumables, Food & Water, Trash) with per-category toggles, drag-and-drop sort order, collapsible sections, ItemRack equipment sets, and an optional bag/bank value total.
## Author: ludvigaf
## Version: 1.0.0
## RequiredDeps: ElvUI
## OptionalDeps: ItemRack, Auctionator
